    desc: 'The classic two-day loop of the Malá Fatra \u2014 up through the Diery gorges to the ferrata crown of Veľký Rozsutec, then the airy red ridge over Stoh and Chleb to Veľký Kriváň, and home along the Baraniarky crest above the Vrátna valley. Slovakia\u2019s most beloved skyline, walked as one circle from Štefanová.',
    dogNote: 'A serious alpine loop. The Diery gorges and the climb up Veľký Rozsutec run over chains and ladders that most dogs cannot manage \u2014 take the marked bypass or save the ferrata for another day. The rest is open, exposed ridgeline: two full days, springs and huts along the way, for a fit and sure-footed dog.',
